-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §155 מיצוי תביעות: the agreement exhausts the
-- parties' claims on what it settles, save §154 and the negotiations it
-- lists: the cost of framework agreements (applied by a uniform rise of the
-- tables, or a separate supplement, if not agreed in 90 days), further
-- populations, the move to an accrual pension, and the matters of the union
-- secretary's letter of 25.12.08 — to end by 31.3.09.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `155 מיצוי תביעות`

DECLARE `matter` IS ONE OF
    `a matter this agreement settles`
    `the updating of section 154`
    `the cost of a framework agreement`
    `the reform for further populations`
    `the move from a budgetary to an accrual pension`
    `the matters of the union secretary's letter of 25.12.08`
    `a new economic demand raising the cost of employment`

-- ¶1: no further negotiation on what the agreement settles, nor on new
-- economic demands, save §154 and (א)–(ד).
@ref akn:art_155
GIVEN m IS A `matter`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may be negotiated` m IF
    NOT (m EQUALS `a matter this agreement settles` OR m EQUALS `a new economic demand raising the cost of employment`)

-- (א): a framework agreement's cost; not agreed within 90 days of its
-- signing, it is applied (1) to reform teachers by a uniform rise of the
-- salary tables at its cost, (2) to the others by a supplement on a separate
-- payslip line with the shekel supplements raised by it, (3) back-dated to
-- the cost's agreed spread.
@ref akn:art_155__para_a akn:art_155__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_155__para_a__subpara_2 akn:art_155__para_a__subpara_3
DECLARE `way of applying a framework cost` IS ONE OF
    `as the parties agreed`
    `a uniform rise of the reform salary tables`
    `a separate supplement line, and the shekel supplements raised by it`
    `not yet decided`

GIVEN `days since the framework agreement was signed` IS A NUMBER, `the parties agreed` IS A BOOLEAN, `under the reform` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `way of applying a framework cost`
DECIDE `how a framework cost is applied` `days since the framework agreement was signed` `the parties agreed` `under the reform` IS
    BRANCH IF `the parties agreed` THEN `as the parties agreed`
           IF `days since the framework agreement was signed` LESS THAN 90 THEN `not yet decided`
           IF `under the reform` THEN `a uniform rise of the reform salary tables`
           OTHERWISE `a separate supplement line, and the shekel supplements raised by it`

-- (ב)–(ד): the further matters; (ב) lists kindergarten teachers among the
-- populations whose reform agreement is still to be negotiated, while parts
-- לז–מ set the kindergarten teachers' week and pay (F-ofek-hadash-base-155-a).
-- The reading adopted: the "גננות" of (ב) are those outside §7(יז), as the
-- preamble (its last "והואיל") puts it.
@ref akn:art_155__para_b akn:art_155__para_c akn:art_155__para_d
DECLARE `population named in 155(ב)` IS ONE OF
    `kindergarten teachers`
    `teaching employees in instruction roles`
    `supervisors`
    `Shelach teachers`
    `teaching employees in colleges and seminars`
    `teaching employees on agricultural farms and marine centres`
    `integrating and paramedical kindergarten teachers`
    `kindergarten cluster managers`
    `Milo"a kindergarten teachers`
    `hospital kindergarten teachers`
    `further populations of teaching employees`

`the parts that set kindergarten teachers' terms` MEANS LIST "לז", "לח", "לט", "מ"
`155(ב) leaves to a later agreement a population parts לז–מ already cover` MEANS
    count `the parts that set kindergarten teachers' terms` GREATER THAN 0
#ASSERT `155(ב) leaves to a later agreement a population parts לז–מ already cover`

-- (ה): the further negotiation is intensive and ends by 31.3.09.
@ref akn:art_155__para_e
`the further negotiation ends by` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 31 3 2009

#ASSERT `may be negotiated` `the cost of a framework agreement`
#ASSERT NOT `may be negotiated` `a new economic demand raising the cost of employment`
#ASSERT `how a framework cost is applied` 90 FALSE TRUE EQUALS `a uniform rise of the reform salary tables`
#ASSERT `how a framework cost is applied` 89 FALSE TRUE EQUALS `not yet decided`
